"},{"p":28,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Did you come through the Canal?"},{"p":28,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Three days."},{"p":29,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Teddy, how could you get from Savannah, Georgia to California in three days?"},{"p":29,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"How can you?"},{"p":29,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. Can you get there that fast?"},{"p":29,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. That's the way the boat came. Because I was on one of them tankers. I mean -- they carried them animals."},{"p":29,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Freighters?"},{"p":29,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Freighters, yeah."},{"p":29,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah? Cattle, like cattle --"},{"p":29,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Cattle freighters, yeah."},{"p":29,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":29,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Cattle. I come home on one of them."},{"p":29,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"You came through the Canal?"},{"p":29,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":29,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"The Panama?"},{"p":29,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":29,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"And all the way to the West Coast in three days?"},{"p":29,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Three days. 'Cause they Didn't lose no time."},{"p":29,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Wow. Well, I guess with animals they've got to move them fast."},{"p":29,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"That's right."},{"p":29,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Well, anyway, we're getting a little ahead of the story, but that's really interesting. So you were playing"},{"p":30,"b":0,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":30,"b":1,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Playing in Atlanta."},{"p":30,"b":2,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."},{"p":30,"b":3,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"What happened to the --"},{"p":30,"b":4,"s":"","x":"[See, Stepin' Fetchit]"},{"p":30,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He stranded us down there."},{"p":30,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Oh, I see."},{"p":30,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"He stranded us down there and I had to get home some way, so I come home on a freighter."},{"p":30,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I see."},{"p":30,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And that's the only kind of money I had, to get a freighter."}]}